/LAB8/E OVERLAY FOR GOUTERMAN (LDF-V5E)         -JVZ-

/THIS OVERLAY ADDS 7 NEW FUNCTIONS: 'FADC','FDAC','FDVM',
CNT','FTNC' AND 'FLGS' TO LAB-FOCAL.


/'FCNT','FTNC' TAKE DATA FROM THE PHOTON COUNTER; 'FDVM'
EADS THE KEITHLEY PICOAMMETER; 'FDAC' SETS THE D/A CON-
/VERTERS; 'FADC' READS THE A/D CONVERTER; 'FLGS' TESTS
/UNSERVICED EVENT FLAGS AND 'FSM' RUNS THE THREE STEPPING
/MOTORS.  A PATCH TO 'FQ' ALLOWS THE SCHMITT TRIGGERS TO
/INITIATE EXTERNAL SUBROUTINE CALLS.

/'FADC(N)' READS THE NTH CHANNEL OF THE 10-BIT A/D
/'FADC(N,M)' AVERAGES NTH CHANNEL M TIMES (M .LT. 2^14)
/'FDAC(N,V) PRODUCES A SIGNAL ON THE NTH D/A OUTPUT
/'FDVM(N)' READS EITHER CHANNEL '1' OR '2' OF THE DVM
/'FCNT(T)' RETURNS THE NUMBER OF COUNTS IN TIME T (MSEC).
/'FTNC(C,MAXT)' RETURNS THE TIME (MSEC) TO GET C COUNTS
/'FQ(P,S,T)' DEFINES AN EXTERNAL SUBROUTINE FOR S-TRIGGER
/'FLGS()' READS ALL UNSERVICED EVENT FLAGS
/'FLGS(M)' TESTS -AND CLEARS- FLAGS SPECIFIED BY THE MASK
/'FSM(DRIVE,STEPS)' CONTROLS THE STEPPING MOTORS (V.I.)

/ THE 'FADC' FUNCTION HAS A 'SIGNAL-AVERAGING' OPTION:
/ IF YOU SPECIFY A SECOND ARGUMENT IT WILL RETURN THE
/ AVERAGE OF THAT MANY READINGS ON THE CHANNEL SELECTED.


ADC1,   ADSK            /WAIT
        JMP .-1
        ADRB            /READ ANSWER
        FLOATR          /CONVERT TO FLOATING-POINT

FADC,   FIXIT           /ADC FUNCTION FOR THE LAB8/E
        ADLM            /SELECT CHANNEL
        ADST            /START THE FIRST CONVERSION
        TSTCMA          /IS THERE A SECOND ARGUMENT?
        JMP ADC1        /NO

        PUSHJ           /GET REPETITION COUNT
            EVAL
        CIF P
        FENT
        FPUT FLAC
        FPUT FLOP
        FEXT
        NEGATE          /DO THIS IN DOUBLE PRECISION
        PUTFLAC
        FIXIT
        DCA OVER        /SO WE CAN DO 10,000 SAMPLES
        DCA LORD

ADC2,   CLL             /CLEAR FOR CARRY PROPAGATION
        DCA SIGN
        ADSK            /LOOP OVERLAPS A/D CONVERSION
        JMP .-1
        ADRB
        ADST            /START THE NEXT CONVERSION
        SDLD
        TAD LORD        /SUM LEAST SIGNIFICANT BITS
        DCA LORD
        SDRD
        SPA CLA
        CMA             /EXTEND THE SIGN BIT
        SZL
        IAC             /AND ADD IN THE CARRY
        TAD SIGN

        ISZ OVER        /DONE?
        JMP ADC2
        ISZ HORD
        JMP ADC2
        DCA HORD

        NORMALIZE       /EXPONENT= '27'
        CIF P
        FENT
        FDIV FLOP
        FPUT FLAC
        FEXT
        RETURN          /THE AVERAGED VALUE


